OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBright
OL,6,Fintervals and a few showers during the
OL,7,Fevening. Showers will die out
OL,8,Fovernight with some clear spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping, these mainly in the east.
OL,10,FLight winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FA largely dry day with sunny
OL,13,Fspells and feeling quite warm. Cloud
OL,14,Fwill increase in the afternoon to
OL,15,Fbring the odd light shower.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry
OL,18,Fwith long sunny spells on Monday and
OL,19,Fbecoming a little warmer. Cooler and
OL,20,Fcloudier on Tuesday and Wednesday with
OL,21,Fsome showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
